A '''lotus seed''' or '''lotus nut''' is the [[seed]] of plants in the genus ''[[Nelumbo]]'', particularly the species ''[[Nelumbo nucifera]]''. The seeds are used in [[Asian cuisine]] and [[traditional medicine]]. Mostly sold in dried, shelled form, the seeds are rich in [[protein]], [[B vitamins]], and [[Mineral (nutrient)|dietary minerals]].
